# BEAT 10 — the board, filmed with fourteen agents in four teams (tapes/_teams.tape,
# tapes/_more.tape), more than one screen of tiles holds. /board is one row per
# agent: state, label, its own last line. ⇥ flips the same overview into a wall
# of live transcripts, three across; walking down scrolls the wall rather than
# shrinking it, and the selection never leaves the screen. Still view-only - ↵
# and ^Y leave it for a conversation; nothing is operated from it.
Output .work/out/10-board.mp4
Source .work/head.tape
Hide
Source .work/stage.tape
Source tapes/_teams.tape
Source tapes/_more.tape
Type "@all we're adding per-key rate limiting to the gateway. maya take the middleware, omar the 429 state in the client, priya a --rate-limit flag, luca the changelog."
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show
Sleep 1500ms
Type "/board"
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 3500ms

# The tiled wall: every agent's live transcript at once, shelved by team.
Tab
Sleep 4s
Down
Sleep 1500ms
Down
Sleep 1500ms
Down
Sleep 1500ms
Down
Sleep 2500ms
Right
Sleep 1200ms
Up
Sleep 1200ms
Up
Sleep 1200ms
Up
Sleep 1200ms
Up
Sleep 2500ms
